<title>POLAND: KPBP BICK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KPBP BICK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.13 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.23 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.19 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		    9.37 vs   6.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.93 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.23 vs   2.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.52 vs   2.39</p>
<p> Sales		   63.41 vs  45.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is KPBP</p>
<p>Bick SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
